To find the correct answer, we refer to the Mizoram Municipalities Act, 2007 (MMA 2007). 

Under Section 25(2) of the Mizoram Municipalities Act, 2007, the Joint Committee shall consist of the following members:
1. Two nominees of each constituent Municipality or local authority;
2. One nominee of each of the concerned Departments of the State Government or of the concerned Municipalities or of the concerned local authority;
3. Such expert or experts as the State Government may nominate;
4. Director of Local Bodies who shall also act as a convener of the Committee.

Since all four statements (1, 2, 3, and 4) are correct components of the Joint Committee as per Section 25(2) of the Act, Option A is the correct answer.

[ANSWER: A]
